# plcproj File Rules

The `.plcproj` is an MSBuild XML file that registers all PLC source files.

## Critical Rules

- **Path separators**: backslashes `\` in `Include` attributes
- **Always** add `<SubType>Code</SubType>` for Compile items
- **Methods are NOT registered separately** — only the parent `.TcPOU`
- **Match disk path** exactly (case-sensitive in some builds)
- **No duplicates** — check before adding
- Prefer MCP `twincat_plcproj_verify` / `twincat_plcproj_sync` over hand-editing when available (see `twincat3-plcproj-safety`)

